  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0\n- First release, extracted from the MILK SUITE project MilkSuite.Twilio.Sms.\n- MessagingClient: SendSms, SendMms, SendWhatsApp (single and bulk), Send/SendMany from a OutgoingMessage, GetStatus, WaitForDelivery.\n- MessagingOptions: AccountSid + API key pair, optional default senders and status callback. No built-in defaults: every value comes from the host application.\n- Helpers: SmsRecipients (E.164 normalization, list parsing), SmsMediaUrls, WhatsAppAddress.",
